{"candidate_id":"figure-analysis:Figure5:214ef579eadb481f","artifact_id":"Figure5","visual_type":"flowchart","description":"Two-panel component ablation visual for ReCA on ViStory. Each panel shows four cumulative horizontal bars, with components added sequentially from baseline through global allocation, shot decomposition, and state propagation. Panel (a) is Wan 2.7; panel (b) is HappyHorse 1.0.","components":[{"name":"Wan 2.7 baseline","role":"Initial condition in panel (a)","visual_evidence":"Blue horizontal bar labeled “(I) Baseline” with score 41.2."},{"name":"Wan 2.7 global allocation","role":"First added ReCA component in panel (a)","visual_evidence":"Green bar labeled “(II) + Global Alloc.” with score 53.7."},{"name":"Wan 2.7 shot decomposition","role":"Second added ReCA component in panel (a)","visual_evidence":"Yellow bar labeled “(III) + Shot Decomp.” with score 56.4."},{"name":"Wan 2.7 state propagation","role":"Third added ReCA component in panel (a)","visual_evidence":"Orange bar labeled “(IV) + State Prop.” with score 63.0."},{"name":"HappyHorse 1.0 baseline","role":"Initial condition in panel (b)","visual_evidence":"Blue horizontal bar labeled “(I) Baseline” with score 37.8."},{"name":"HappyHorse 1.0 global allocation","role":"First added ReCA component in panel (b)","visual_evidence":"Green bar labeled “(II) + Global Alloc.” with score 51.9."},{"name":"HappyHorse 1.0 shot decomposition","role":"Second added ReCA component in panel (b)","visual_evidence":"Yellow bar labeled “(III) + Shot Decomp.” with score 54.7."},{"name":"HappyHorse 1.0 state propagation","role":"Third added ReCA component in panel (b)","visual_evidence":"Orange bar labeled “(IV) + State Prop.” with score 62.5."}],"relationships":[{"source_component":"Wan 2.7 baseline","relation":"is followed by addition of","target_component":"Wan 2.7 global allocation"},{"source_component":"Wan 2.7 global allocation","relation":"is followed by addition of","target_component":"Wan 2.7 shot decomposition"},{"source_component":"Wan 2.7 shot decomposition","relation":"is followed by addition of","target_component":"Wan 2.7 state propagation"},{"source_component":"HappyHorse 1.0 baseline","relation":"is followed by addition of","target_component":"HappyHorse 1.0 global allocation"},{"source_component":"HappyHorse 1.0 global allocation","relation":"is followed by addition of","target_component":"HappyHorse 1.0 shot decomposition"},{"source_component":"HappyHorse 1.0 shot decomposition","relation":"is followed by addition of","target_component":"HappyHorse 1.0 state propagation"}],"findings":["Both panels show monotonic score gains as ReCA components are cumulatively added.","Wan 2.7 increases from 41.2 at baseline to 63.0 with all three components.","HappyHorse 1.0 increases from 37.8 at baseline to 62.5 with all three components.","The largest visible increment in each panel occurs when global allocation is added.","State propagation produces the final substantial increase in both panels."],"citations":[{"section_id":"sec-6","path_id":"6","quote":"Figure 5 shows a monotone gain from each ReCA component on both proprietary backbones."},{"section_id":"sec-6","path_id":"6","quote":"On Wan 2.7, the baseline context policy scores 41.2 on the ViStory average; evidence-bounded global allocation raises it to 53.7"},{"section_id":"sec-6","path_id":"6","quote":"context-bounded shot decomposition raises it to 56.4 (+2.7), and structured state propagation reaches 63.0 (+6.6)."},{"section_id":"sec-6","path_id":"6","quote":"HappyHorse 1.0 follows the same ordering: 37.8 → 51.9 → 54.7 → 62.5."},{"section_id":"sec-6","path_id":"6","quote":"Each bar incrementally adds one ReCA component on top of the bar above it"}],"confidence":0.99,"provenance":{"image_sha256":"301f1803f381e62cb1b2acbb34b9f3913b8eee33e49cf352a632e41089bbffc9","context_sha256":"8e5e14432c225cdd73fb33e41a1efdf00e1bcf74d4f275543d46200064204977","route_id":"figure-qa-luna","protocol":"openai_chat_completions","re